#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:44 954d3e025b2a47d1bc14dfdcc8dc9b5d
msgid "There is exactly one link rule: the aggregate target :code:`foc::foc`. It carries both :code:`foc::foc_c` and :code:`foc::foc_cpp`, and the package metadata guarantees the order."
msgstr "只需要记一条链接规则：聚合目标 :code:`foc::foc` 。它同时带 :code:`foc::foc_c` 与 :code:`foc::foc_cpp` ，顺序由包元数据保证。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:49 cb598d6d114e4c4d9ef82e6c3096eb17
msgid "A C consumer still links the C++ runtime. The ABI is stable, the implementation is C++: set :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` (or add one empty :code:`.cpp`), otherwise the link fails on :code:`__cxa_*`. This is a documented boundary, not an accident."
msgstr "C 使用者仍要链接 C++ 运行时。ABI 是稳定的，但实现是 C++：把 :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` 设上（或加一个空 :code:`.cpp` ），否则会在 :code:`__cxa_*` 上链接失败。这是写明的边界，不是失误。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:54 9785833e0b864236a139ab1ab4697791
msgid "_`3. Pick a face`"
msgstr "_`3. 选择使用面`"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:56 aab8e581a3ed4aaca6a65da284f7658b
msgid "**C++17** — board-level work, your own :code:`HalPolicy`, your own gains: see :ref:`the C++ path <cpp-control-step>`."
msgstr "**C++17** ——上板开发，用自己的 :code:`HalPolicy` 、自己的增益：见 :ref:`C++ 路径 <cpp-control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:58 141efa4b80314a218eeb81637eeebd99
msgid "**C11** — non-C++ projects and glue code over the frozen ABI: see :ref:`the C path <c-control-step>`."
msgstr "**C11** ——非 C++ 工程，走冻结 ABI 的胶水层：见 :ref:`C 路径 <c-control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:60 b9afe9aaaa254972a33a5b5d9aa58cdb
msgid "**Python** — host-side scripts on top of the C API: see :ref:`the Python path <python-control-step>`."
msgstr "**Python** ——建立在 C API 之上的上位机脚本：见 :ref:`Python 路径 <python-control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:63 d161c37201da475da2872a9b2a502811
msgid "Each snippet on that page is complete enough to compile, and the C and Python faces run on the stub HAL with library defaults (20 kHz, 500 ns dead time, 5 A limit, 24 V bus)."
msgstr "那一页的每段代码都足以编译；C 与 Python 面跑在桩 HAL 与库内默认值上（20 kHz、500 ns 死区、5 A 限流、24 V 母线）。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:67 eafdb1364c5d4a27b60dce8d025a593f
msgid "_`4. Prove it yourself`"
msgstr "_`4. 自己验证`"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:89 f802a5d85d224cf68018fa97fba001e3
msgid "What is deliberately **not** verified — dead-time compensation, ADC timing, EMI, ISR worst-case time, flash/RAM footprint — is listed item by item under :ref:`honest limits <honest-limits>`."
msgstr "明确 **没有** 验证的内容——死区补偿、ADC 时序、EMI、ISR 最坏执行时间、Flash/RAM 占用——逐条列在 :ref:`诚实边界 <honest-limits>` 。"